{"id":"20465fe6fc759475","group":"62","path":"62/62-ex-ARITH-not-ATR.md","title":"Arithmetical Omega Model Refutes ATR","display":"ex-ARITH-not-ATR — Arithmetical Omega Model Refutes ATR","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-ex-ARITH-not-ATR","aliases":["62-ex-ARITH-not-ATR"],"display":"ex-ARITH-not-ATR — Arithmetical Omega Model Refutes ATR","depends_on":["[[62-df-REC-ARITH]]","[[62-df-omega-model]]","[[62-df-ACA0]]","[[62-df-ATR0]]","[[62-thm-minimal-omega-models]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Example I.11.2; Proposition V.2.5","source_pages":[39,175],"source_pdf_pages":[57,193]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-ex-ARITH-not-ATR"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-ex-ARITH-not-ATR</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-ARITH-not-ATR — Arithmetical Omega Model Refutes ATR"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e2d400eef79d26fb\" href=\"?note=e2d400eef79d26fb\" title=\"62-df-REC-ARITH\">62-df-REC-ARITH</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" href=\"?note=5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" title=\"62-df-omega-model\">62-df-omega-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cfaecdc022e51c90\" href=\"?note=cfaecdc022e51c90\" title=\"62-df-ATR0\">62-df-ATR0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eea6fa5291974166\" href=\"?note=eea6fa5291974166\" title=\"62-thm-minimal-omega-models\">62-thm-minimal-omega-models</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Example I.11.2; Proposition V.2.5"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>39</span><span>175</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57</span><span>193</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>集合族、模型和理论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e2d400eef79d26fb\" href=\"?note=e2d400eef79d26fb\" title=\"62-df-REC-ARITH\">62-df-REC-ARITH</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" href=\"?note=5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" title=\"62-df-omega-model\">62-df-omega-model</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"cfaecdc022e51c90\" href=\"?note=cfaecdc022e51c90\" title=\"62-df-ATR0\">62-df-ATR0</a>；最小性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"eea6fa5291974166\" href=\"?note=eea6fa5291974166\" title=\"62-thm-minimal-omega-models\">62-thm-minimal-omega-models</a>。</p>\n<p>上游理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\mathrm{ATR}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\mathrm{ATR}_0\\)</span>，模型集合族为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ARITH}\">\\(\\mathrm{ARITH}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}ARITH\\text{-}not\\text{-}ATR}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{ARITH}},\\mathrm{ACA}_0)\\land\n\\neg\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{ARITH}},\\mathrm{ATR}_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}ARITH\\text{-}not\\text{-}ATR}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{ARITH}},\\mathrm{ACA}_0)\\land\n\\neg\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{ARITH}},\\mathrm{ATR}_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>见证：沿标准自然数良序，以前驱层级的 Turing jump 作为下一截面。若整个层级 H 在 ARITH 中，则 H 归约到某个有限跳跃；但其所有更高截面也归约到 H，违反严格跳跃定理。因此每个有限阶段分别存在，并不提供一个编码全部阶段的 H。对应原文 V.2.5 的论证，未将 H 字面等同于任何特定 ω 跳跃编号。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Example I.11.2; Proposition V.2.5；纸面页 39, 175；PDF 页 57, 193。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-REC-ARITH","status":"resolved","id":"e2d400eef79d26fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-REC-ARITH]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-omega-model","status":"resolved","id":"5ed7a378ff9d39c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-omega-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ACA0","status":"resolved","id":"35af454d9caa8c9d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ACA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ATR0","status":"resolved","id":"cfaecdc022e51c90","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ATR0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-thm-minimal-omega-models","status":"resolved","id":"eea6fa5291974166","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-thm-minimal-omega-models]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-REC-ARITH","status":"resolved","id":"e2d400eef79d26fb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"集合族、模型和理论见 [[62-df-REC-ARITH]]、[[62-df-omega-model]]、[[62-df-ACA0]]、[[62-df-ATR0]]；最小性见 [[62-thm-minimal-omega-models]]。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-omega-model","status":"resolved","id":"5ed7a378ff9d39c6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"集合族、模型和理论见 [[62-df-REC-ARITH]]、[[62-df-omega-model]]、[[62-df-ACA0]]、[[62-d